# Append these lines to the .gitignore that `nuxi init` generates in gui/.
# The OpenAPI snapshot is committed (it's what makes codegen reproducible/diff-reviewable);
# everything openapi-ts generates FROM it is derived output and should not be.
#
# A bare `!app/generated/**/openapi.snapshot.json` negation does NOT work: git can't
# re-include a file whose parent directories are themselves excluded by app/generated/** --
# each intermediate directory needs its own un-ignore rule first.
app/generated/**
!app/generated/
!app/generated/rest/
!app/generated/rest/openapi.snapshot.json
